  - m_Id: 15959978559401984
    m_Localized: Hank would have liked it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15960262295678976
    m_Localized: The most dangerous cold weapon according to popculture
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962022108196864
    m_Localized: It's pizza time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15960382458294272
    m_Localized: A piece of metal in the shape of jelly. About two years were spent
      on this development
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961992353804288
    m_Localized: For a fun evening
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961866461769728
    m_Localized: "Contains no alcohol (we don\u2019t need any trouble)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961159667019776
    m_Localized: 'One rule: under no circumstances should you say which country it
      was invented in'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961480191537152
    m_Localized: Not French
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961510109507584
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ll need to crack a couple of eggs"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961448579067904
    m_Localized: 110% not from crabs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961610294652928
    m_Localized: "Life didn\u2019t give you lemons, so buy lemonade from us"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961234149470208
    m_Localized: Spices with potato content
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961698094018560
    m_Localized: Made from processed bones and sunflower oil, kids should like it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961810522337280
    m_Localized: Stop writing that you need to use carrots in the recipe! And seriously,
      what even is this "carrot" of yours?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962051896143872
    m_Localized: The Chinese government is definitely not involved in this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962306121297920
    m_Localized: 'If you''re a fan of this sort of thing, please contact us at this
      number: +1 646-766-4000'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962453010018304
    m_Localized: The perfect choice for surviving a nuclear apocalypse with the whole
      family!
